  ⚠ vue(no-deprecated-filter): Filters are deprecated.
   ╭─[no_deprecated_filter.tsx:1:19]
 1 │ <template><div>{{ a | b }}</div></template>
   ·                   ─────
   ╰────
  help: Vue 3 removed Vue 2's `|` filter syntax; call a method or computed property instead (e.g. `{{ formatted(value) }}` instead of `{{ value | formatted }}`).

